 {kind:"text",id:"t-limits",content:{prose:"The written run summary and the results table disagree. The summary gives a slightly different up and down split and fold changes of roughly three to four for ISG15, MX1 and IFIT1, whereas the table gives smaller values for those genes and a maximum absolute fold change near three. This report uses the table, because it is the data the plot is drawn from, but the discrepancy should be resolved before anyone quotes a fold change. Beyond that, the run used three replicates per group and sample C3 has a low library size, so individual p-values may be less stable than they look. No gene set or pathway enrichment test was run, so the interferon interpretation rests on three named genes and prior expectation, not on a formal test."}},
